(footprint "ESP32-C3_SuperMini_Socket" (version 20260206) (generator "pcbnew") (generator_version "10.0") (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "ESP32-C3 Super Mini on two 1x8 female headers (2.54 mm sockets), 15.24 mm between rows; the module plugs in and is never soldered. Top view, USB at the top: pads 1-8 left row top to bottom GPIO5 GPIO6 GPIO7 GPIO8 GPIO9 GPIO10 GPIO20 GPIO21, pads 9-16 right row top to bottom 5V GND 3V3 GPIO4 GPIO3 GPIO2 GPIO1 GPIO0. Module outline 18 x 22.52 mm centred on the pins. A rule area under the antenna end (the end away from USB) keeps tracks, vias and copper pour out; the antenna position on the module is UNCONFIRMED")
